cff-version: 1.2.0
title: Space Object Register Ontology
message: If you use this work, please cite it.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Rovai
    given-names: Fabio
  - name: "Kampakis and Co. Ltd (The Tesseract Academy)"
repository-code: "https://github.com/fabio-rovai/space-object-register-ontology"
abstract: >-
  An ontology for the integrity of space object catalogues, in which identity
  and disposition are dated claims by a named catalogue rather than properties
  of an object, tested against CelesTrak SATCAT and McDowell's General Catalog
  of Artificial Space Objects.
keywords:
  - space domain awareness
  - resident space object
  - register integrity
  - ontology
  - SHACL
doi: 10.5281/zenodo.22002834
license: MIT
